<title>BANGLADESH: Eleven killed, 50 injured in Bangladesh bus crash.</title>
<headline>Eleven killed, 50 injured in Bangladesh bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 11 people were killed and 50 injured in a head-on collision between two crowded buses on Tuesday at Chandina, 45 miles (70 km) from Dhaka, state-run television said.</p>
</text>
